{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsealed: The Mare</strong>\u00a0is a psychological horror game blending terrifying gameplay with a dark, emotional story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Vera, caught between dreams and memories, you search for what should have been forgotten. As fragments of your family\u2019s tragedy surface, they poison your mind and intertwine with your memories, distorting the dream into something increasingly horrific. In this nightmare, everything feels connected - bound by guilt, sorrow, and something far darker you cannot yet comprehend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>three chapters</strong> of an unfolding nightmare, each distorting reality in new and unpredictable ways. Use tools like the <strong>flashlight</strong>, <strong>lighter</strong>, <strong>bulbs</strong>, and <strong>camera</strong> wisely as resources grow scarce, and rely on your <strong>Focus\u00a0- a memory-driven</strong> vision that lets you recall the past, reshape the dream, and solve puzzles that defy logic. <strong>Destroy fragments</strong> of her memories to weaken her hold, if only for a moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/d7c62ccfaa404d53505c30496e3ef5c8.poster.avif?t=1768733834\" width=702 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/d7c62ccfaa404d53505c30496e3ef5c8.webm?t=1768733834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/d7c62ccfaa404d53505c30496e3ef5c8.mp4?t=1768733834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not liberation; it\u2019s merely another memory, sealed away.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Chapters of Descent</strong>: Experience a journey through dream, memory, and guilt - each chapter revealing new layers of your family\u2019s tragedy and the nightmare that binds it together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Sight</strong>: Tap into Vera\u2019s fading memories to shape and influence the nightmare itself. Your focus bridges dream and reality, allowing you to recall lost moments and momentarily control the world around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles:</strong> Solve puzzles which blend logic, memory and perception as the line between dream and reality begins to collapse around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Terror:</strong> A mix of constant dread and unpredictable scares that keep you on edge from beginning to end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen your senses:\u00a0</strong>Track teddies by giggles, sneezes, and footsteps - while staying alert to whispers, breaths, laughter, creaks in the floor, doors that open or slam shut, and lights that flicker or break. Every detail could be the warning that saves you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools at Your Disposal:</strong> Use tools such as the flashlight, lighter, bulbs, and camera, and find rare supplies to keep them working. Scarce but invaluable for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsealed: The Mare</i> is not only about survival, but about endurance, adaptation, and facing a nightmare that feels all too familiar. Learn from your mistakes, balance caution with desperation, and dare to confront what hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beneath the fear lies something deeper - fragments of the past, buried guilt, and truths never meant to surface. The Mare may be more than just a sinister presence; perhaps someone you once knew... or something else entirely. Familiarity lingers in every corner, yet nothing feels quite real - as if memory and nightmare have fused into one.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning: This game contains flashing lights and intense scares that may not be suitable for all players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3492710?t=1768733834","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/bd05f085812b478e60dcbea63a55e0d01c8fd5b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768733834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/bb10f16674b8d781a540ac0e7fb130c8143f8996/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768733834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/bb10f16674b8d781a540ac0e7fb130c8143f8996/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768733834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains intense horror elements, including disturbing imagery, dark environments, and moments of extreme tension and fear. While there are no graphic or bloody scenes, the presence of supernatural entities (the ghost/the mare) and unsettling paranormal activity may be distressing for younger or sensitive players. There is no sexual content."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4245180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsealed: The Mare</strong>\u00a0is a psychological horror game blending terrifying gameplay with a dark, emotional story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Vera, caught between dreams and memories, you search for what should have been forgotten. As fragments of your family\u2019s tragedy surface, they poison your mind and intertwine with your memories, distorting the dream into something increasingly horrific. In this nightmare, everything feels connected - bound by guilt, sorrow, and something far darker you cannot yet comprehend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>three chapters</strong> of an unfolding nightmare, each distorting reality in new and unpredictable ways. Use tools like the <strong>flashlight</strong>, <strong>lighter</strong>, <strong>bulbs</strong>, and <strong>camera</strong> wisely as resources grow scarce, and rely on your <strong>Focus\u00a0- a memory-driven</strong> vision that lets you recall the past, reshape the dream, and solve puzzles that defy logic. <strong>Destroy fragments</strong> of her memories to weaken her hold, if only for a moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/d7c62ccfaa404d53505c30496e3ef5c8.poster.avif?t=1768733834\" width=702 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/d7c62ccfaa404d53505c30496e3ef5c8.webm?t=1768733834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/d7c62ccfaa404d53505c30496e3ef5c8.mp4?t=1768733834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not liberation; it\u2019s merely another memory, sealed away.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Chapters of Descent</strong>: Experience a journey through dream, memory, and guilt - each chapter revealing new layers of your family\u2019s tragedy and the nightmare that binds it together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Sight</strong>: Tap into Vera\u2019s fading memories to shape and influence the nightmare itself. Your focus bridges dream and reality, allowing you to recall lost moments and momentarily control the world around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles:</strong> Solve puzzles which blend logic, memory and perception as the line between dream and reality begins to collapse around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Terror:</strong> A mix of constant dread and unpredictable scares that keep you on edge from beginning to end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen your senses:\u00a0</strong>Track teddies by giggles, sneezes, and footsteps - while staying alert to whispers, breaths, laughter, creaks in the floor, doors that open or slam shut, and lights that flicker or break. Every detail could be the warning that saves you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools at Your Disposal:</strong> Use tools such as the flashlight, lighter, bulbs, and camera, and find rare supplies to keep them working. Scarce but invaluable for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsealed: The Mare</i> is not only about survival, but about endurance, adaptation, and facing a nightmare that feels all too familiar. Learn from your mistakes, balance caution with desperation, and dare to confront what hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beneath the fear lies something deeper - fragments of the past, buried guilt, and truths never meant to surface. The Mare may be more than just a sinister presence; perhaps someone you once knew... or something else entirely. Familiarity lingers in every corner, yet nothing feels quite real - as if memory and nightmare have fused into one.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning: This game contains flashing lights and intense scares that may not be suitable for all players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Gamhalla"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/0c27e90a4f2816e405e8cb6c06533f41329075da/header.jpg?t=1768733834","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492710/1831984478/2241f04956241f219fe638936c6a2f9e3ba965ad/1765828109/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765833066","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492710/1831984478/2241f04956241f219fe638936c6a2f9e3ba965ad/1765828109/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765833066","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492710/1831984478/2241f04956241f219fe638936c6a2f9e3ba965ad/1765828109/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765833066","id":257250301,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257250301/cdf841fc26e5a151c98f658fa7918a7cead61d79/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765833066"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492710/998344216/24b9ee0bbc428cf1b73656bdfe4f9334001d7876/1750855692/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758128246","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492710/998344216/24b9ee0bbc428cf1b73656bdfe4f9334001d7876/1750855692/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758128246","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492710/998344216/24b9ee0bbc428cf1b73656bdfe4f9334001d7876/1750855692/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758128246","id":257143739,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143739/10f0487b651808a4cd3070d93281480642d80f56/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758128246"}],"name":"Unsealed: The Mare","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st